/F2 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 742 Tm (AcmeCorp Code of Conduct) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 714 Tm (Owner: Legal) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Version 3, effective 1 March 2026) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 686 Tm (Applies to: all employees, contractors and directors) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 658 Tm (1. Why this document exists) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 640 Tm (The code of conduct describes how we expect people at AcmeCorp to behave towards each) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 626 Tm (other, towards customers and suppliers, and with company property and information. It) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 612 Tm (does not cover every situation. When in doubt, ask your manager or the Legal team before) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 598 Tm (acting.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 570 Tm (2. Respect at work) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 552 Tm (Harassment, bullying and discrimination are not tolerated. This applies in the office,) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 538 Tm (at customer sites, at company events and in online channels. Anyone who experiences or) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 524 Tm (sees such behaviour should report it to their manager, to HR, or through the ethics) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 510 Tm (line.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 482 Tm (3. Conflicts of interest) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 464 Tm (A conflict of interest exists when a personal interest could affect a business decision.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 450 Tm (Examples are a financial stake in a supplier, or a family member working for a) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 436 Tm (competitor. Conflicts must be declared to Legal in writing as soon as they are known.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 422 Tm (Declaring a conflict is not an admission of wrongdoing.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 394 Tm (4. Gifts and hospitality) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 376 Tm (Employees may accept gifts from customers or suppliers worth up to 50 EUR. Anything) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 362 Tm (above that value must be declined or handed to Legal. Gifts of cash, or of anything that) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 348 Tm (can be exchanged for cash, are never acceptable. Hospitality such as a business meal is) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 334 Tm (acceptable when it is modest and has a clear business purpose.) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 314 Tm (No employee may offer a gift or payment to a public official.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 286 Tm (5. Confidential information) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 268 Tm (Information about customers, pricing, employees and company plans is confidential unless) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 254 Tm (it has been published by the company. Share it only with people who need it for their) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 240 Tm (work. Do not put confidential information into external tools that have not been) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 226 Tm (approved by IT.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 198 Tm (6. Company property) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 180 Tm (Company equipment, software and accounts are for business use. Limited personal use is) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 166 Tm (acceptable as long as it is legal and does not interfere with work.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 138 Tm (7. Speaking up) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 120 Tm (Concerns can be raised with a manager, with HR, with Legal, or anonymously through the) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 106 Tm (ethics line at ethics@acmecorp.example. AcmeCorp does not allow retaliation against) Tj
/F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 92 Tm (anyone who raises a concern in good faith.) Tj
ET
